      "monotonicity_argument": "For normalized Gram I-A, every added non-right label increases the nonnegative cosine adjacency A entrywise. Perron-Frobenius monotonicity cannot reduce spectral radius from at least 1 to below 1, so no external labels can repair a non-elliptic sparse-shadow principal diagram.",
